pico_usb_ble_hid_bridge is based on host_cdc_msc_hid, Pico-PIO-USB, and BlueKitchen's hog_keyboard_demo. It also uses BlueKitchen's BTstack. 
The licensing of pico_usb_ble_hid_bridge is subject to these licenses.

